  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.2019 describes the content delivery functional architecture in NGN. Thisdetailed architecture is based on the IPTV functional architecture described in RecommendationITU-T Y.1910. Only the NGN architecture options (IMS and non-IMS) are addressed.</abstract>
